   "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
   "text": "3  Runner::submit\n• request_stop() on the job still\n  running (stale, λ = 3)\n• ++generation: its result will be\n  dropped by the generation check\n• wait 120 ms of quiet (debounce:\n  a burst of drags = one run)\n• launch: QtConcurrent::run\n  → compute() on a worker thread",
   "originalText": "3  Runner::submit\n• request_stop() on the job still\n  running (stale, λ = 3)\n• ++generation: its result will be\n  dropped by the generation check\n• wait 120 ms of quiet (debounce:\n  a burst of drags = one run)\n• launch: QtConcurrent::run\n  → compute() on a worker thread",
